 (395, FALSE, E'CAROUSEL', E'OTHER', E'STANDARD', E'OCEAN GIRL', TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, E'PHOTO', NULL, E'https://www.instagram.com/p/DNNestYO_OT/?img_index=1', NULL, NULL, E'2025-08-11', E'6:00 AM', E'It was one of those perfect summer days ☀️. We had filmed OCEAN GIRL, but it played out more like a sun-soaked memory—salty air, waves rolling in, and sunlight turning everything golden. The family was there to bring the magic✨ We crashed the parade, handed out candy, fired water guns 🔫 and ended the day with the ocean behind us, warm and completely at peace 🌊', NULL, NULL, E'#OCEANGIRL #NewMusicFriday #foryoupageシ #Pop #MusicVideo #BehindTheLyrics', E'8/11/2025 6:00:00', NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE),
